<title>USA: Merged MCI-BT to list on NYSE--source.</title>
<headline>Merged MCI-BT to list on NYSE--source.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Concert Plc, the company to be formed by the merger of British Telecommunications Plc and MCI Communications Corp, will be listed on the New York Stock Exchange, according to a source close to BT and MCI.</p>
<p>MCI officials said an announcement would be made at 1430 EDT/1830 GMT but declined other comment.</p>
<p>MCI has signed an agreement to be acquired by BT. The deal is awaiting various regulatory approvals. MCI has said it expects the merger to be completed by autumn.</p>
<p>MCI shares were off 1/8 to 37-1/4. BT ADRs were up 1/4 to 71-7/8.</p>
</text>
